  "body": "OCTOBER 2026 REGISTERED VALUATION: $2,950,000 - ASKING $2,749,000!\r\n\r\nPriced $201,000 below its recent registered valuation, 8 Brown Street presents an outstanding opportunity to secure architectural style, near-new comfort and a premium Takapuna lifestyle.\r\n\r\nOriginally designed by renowned architect Alan Shanahan, 8 Brown Street has been completely reimagined. With new finishes and thoughtful upgrades throughout, this home is brand new in almost every way while retaining the architectural character that makes it so distinctive.\r\n\r\nSet on its own freehold site, it offers sophisticated, low-maintenance living without compromising on space, privacy or quality.\r\n\r\nExpansive open-plan living and dining connects seamlessly with a beautifully appointed new kitchen and dedicated scullery. From here, the home flows outdoors beneath a full louvre-style opening roof system, creating an exceptional all-weather entertaining space.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, two oversized bedrooms are joined by a flexible second living area or office and an added powder room. The enormous downstairs bedroom is positioned on the same level as the main living spaces, adding a valuable single-level living aspect while also providing excellent separation for guests or family.\r\n\r\nTwo beautifully tiled bathrooms with underfloor heating, internal-access double garaging, all-day sunshine and a relaxed coastal outlook complete the picture-all moments from Takapuna Beach and everything Takapuna has to offer.\r\n\r\nKEY FEATURES:\r\n\r\n* Originally designed by renowned architect Alan Shanahan\r\n* Set on its own freehold site, moments from Takapuna\r\n* Fully reclad with a new Code Compliance Certificate issued and comprehensively renovated from top to bottom-making it brand new in almost every way\r\n* Three exceptionally generous bedrooms\r\n* Downstairs bedroom positioned alongside the main living spaces, providing a valuable single-level living aspect\r\n* Two beautifully finished bathrooms plus an upstairs powder room\r\n* Underfloor bathroom heating and sophisticated contemporary tiling\r\n* Beautifully appointed new kitchen with a dedicated scullery\r\n* Spacious open-plan living and dining with seamless indoor-outdoor flow\r\n* All-weather outdoor entertaining beneath a full louvre-style opening roof system\r\n* Flexible second living area, retreat or home office\r\n* Elevated, sun-filled position with a relaxed coastal outlook\r\n* Internal-access double garaging\r\n* Zoned for Takapuna Grammar School and Belmont Intermediate\r\n* Moments from Takapuna Beach, cafes, restaurants, shops and everything Takapuna has to offer\r\n\r\nArchitectural style, near-new comfort and an easy-care lifestyle without sacrificing space-8 Brown Street delivers it all.\r\n\r\nOur vendors' instructions are clear-they are serious about selling.\r\n\r\nCome and experience 8 Brown Street at one of our upcoming open homes. All conjunctional agents and their buyers are warmly welcome.",
